Bind Npc 14431 Zone 2
Quest 460 "[Repeatable Solo] Uruk Hai Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Beth has commissioned you to hunt Uruk Hai. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 1692, 9777, 11692 at direction_543

Requires player level >= 51 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 1250000 experience or 1900000 with premium

direction_543 = location "Uruk Hai" about "Uruk Hai\nA high-level orc race inhabiting the continent of Adonis; distinguishing trait: strong Attack Power" found "El Morad Eslant" at 344 1598 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master! [Sentinel] Beth an urgent from Laiva Village! You must go see her now!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "You came. Residents are shivering in fear due to the Uruk Hai who have converged at the village entrance. Please get rid of them."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "There's a lot of them, but it should be a simple task for someone of your skill level, <selfname>."

On ready
    Say "Thank you. Wasn't it more demanding than you thought?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
